		{"id":"787a967d79aa01ee","type":"text","text":"applied for","x":1077,"y":1634,"width":156,"height":51},
		{"id":"95c8e51f58cadd21","type":"text","text":"Namespaces","x":1326,"y":1621,"width":167,"height":50},
		{"id":"8d4f184c6035888d","type":"text","text":"- Checks if the **container is still alive** -> sends http request to the pod\n-  action: restart","x":-541,"y":3333,"width":561,"height":60},
		{"id":"e0f37f56238c7db0","type":"text","text":"**Liveness Probe**","x":-865,"y":3333,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b5ff95523a414db1","type":"text","text":"**Readiness Probe**","x":-865,"y":3447,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a43f97871ef0e00c","type":"text","text":"`kubectl port-forward --address=0.0.0.0 svc/nodejs-svc 31000:3000 --address=\"0.0.0.0\" &`","x":-925,"y":2860,"width":843,"height":50},
		{"id":"aa90bbc7d5e989b8","type":"text","text":"- Checks if the **container is ready to serve traffic** (latency test)\n- action: get out of service","x":-541,"y":3436,"width":515,"height":82},
		{"id":"619e3d4314ae0771","type":"text","text":"-  Checks if the **application has started successfully**\n-  delays liveness and readiness probes as it checks if the container started correctly then liveness and readiness check the capability of  the container to serve requests\n-  action: restart","x":-541,"y":3543,"width":641,"height":157},
		{"id":"d0c04debccafa29f","type":"text","text":"Startup Probe","x":-865,"y":3592,"width":250,"height":60},
